{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "id": "gen-331",
   "subject": "Question about waitlists and automated notifications",
   "body": "Hello, I am terribly sorry to bother you with this, but could you please point me in the right direction on how we can put patients onto a cancellation queue and have the system automatically ping the next person when an opening pops up? Thank you so much."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-332",
   "subject": "Moving appointments",
   "body": "Hi there, I need to shift an existing visit to a different time slot and provider for a patient. Could you let me know the steps to do this without losing the attached notes? Thanks."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-333",
   "subject": "Updating and searching pharmacy directory entries",
   "body": "Dear Support Team, we are currently trying to update a patient's preferred pharmacy since their usual location recently closed down. Could you please provide instructions on how to search the directory and add a custom pharmacy entry when it is not listed? Your assistance with this matter is appreciated."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-334",
   "subject": "URGENT: Posting payments and ERAs crashing",
   "body": "Hello, I am so sorry to reach out while everything is falling apart, but our billing department is completely blocked right now. Whenever we try to post electronic remittances or apply check payments across multiple invoice lines, the entire ledger module freezes up and throws a server error code. We tried logging out and clearing our browser caches, but nothing is working, and we cannot process any deposits today. Please look into this immediately as our day is completely stalled."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-335",
   "subject": "Claim validation errors",
   "body": "How do we fix claim validation errors before batching claims for submission?"
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-336",
   "subject": "Restricting online booking options",
   "body": "Hi, we are setting up online booking for our patients through the portal. I was wondering how we can restrict these bookings so patients can only select certain visit types and specific providers. Let me know what settings we need to change."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-337",
   "subject": "Incorrect charge on our enterprise bill",
   "body": "Hello, I am looking over our latest subscription invoice and noticed we were double-charged for our tier upgrade this month. This is getting ridiculous since we cleared this up with billing last quarter already. Please credit our account back immediately or I will have to escalate this cancellation."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-338",
   "subject": "Questions regarding out of stock medications",
   "body": "Hi team, I am a bit turned around regarding how to handle alerts when a drug is out of stock at the pharmacy. Is there a specific workflow I should follow to swap the prescription to an alternative therapeutic agent? I tried looking in the drop-down menus during signing but couldn't quite find it."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-339",
   "subject": "Patient portal online booking confusion",
   "body": "Hello, I was looking through our settings and got a bit turned around trying to figure out how patients book appointments online. Could you explain how to limit what visit types show up on the web portal? I am not entirely sure where that configuration lives."
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-340",
   "subject": "Troubleshooting automated appointment reminder delivery",
   "body": "Hello, I am trying to figure out why our automated text and email reminders aren't going out properly. I checked the schedule settings and everything looks turned on, but patients are still calling in saying they never got their confirmation texts. We tried changing the timing window from 24 hours to 48 hours, but that didn't seem to fix it either. Could someone help me trace where these messages are getting stuck?"
  }
 ]
}
